abstract: >-
  An open, source-linked trip-planning dataset covering all 12 sovereign South
  American countries. Version 1.1 provides normalized country planning fields
  and a registry of 44 official-source records with stable identifiers,
  evidence scope, review dates, and maintenance controls.
